00:35:41.910 --> 00:35:45.070
we've ended up in a realized
state for our application

00:35:45.070 --> 00:35:48.360
where we've moved MySQL
off of our single VM.

00:35:48.360 --> 00:35:50.550
We've taken the M out
of our LAMP stack.

00:35:50.550 --> 00:35:52.350
We've moved this load
now to Cloud SQL.

00:35:52.350 --> 00:35:54.090
Our site's operational again.

00:35:54.090 --> 00:35:57.780
And that's really the motivation
